    "The applied schema of project qxdpsomelzpvphkhkqrw, read back from",
    "information_schema after migrations 0001-0006. Not used at runtime.",
    "",
    "Its job is to keep apps/web/src/lib/database.types.ts honest. Those types",
    "are hand-written on purpose: `supabase gen types` widens every CHECK",
    "constraint to `string` and every jsonb column to `Json`, which throws away",
    "exactly the distinctions this app depends on - ToolId, PriceUnit,",
    "temp_unit 'C' | 'F', and the four density resolution states. So the narrow",
    "types stay, and this snapshot plus scripts/check-types-against-schema.mjs",
    "prove they still describe the real tables.",
